  "title": "Risk-to-response planning matrix",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Risk-to-response planning matrix</h2><p>A distributor is entering a new market and implementing a new ERP. Match each issue to the appropriate audit concept or response.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs1-f1\">Risk associated with estimate susceptibility before controls</label><select id=\"aud-m2-tbs1-f1\"><option value=\"Inherent risk\">Inherent risk</option><option value=\"Detection risk\">Detection risk</option><option value=\"Engagement fee risk\">Engagement fee risk</option><option value=\"No audit risk\">No audit risk</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs1-f2\">Risk associated with ineffective approval controls</label><select id=\"aud-m2-tbs1-f2\"><option value=\"Control risk\">Control risk</option><option value=\"Detection risk\">Detection risk</option><option value=\"Only sampling risk\">Only sampling risk</option><option value=\"No financial-reporting implication\">No financial-reporting implication</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs1-f3\">Illustrative detection risk, as a percentage</label><input id=\"aud-m2-tbs1-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m2-tbs1-f4\">Response to post-conversion risks</label><select id=\"aud-m2-tbs1-f4\"><option value=\"Reassess timing and add appropriate post-conversion procedures\">Reassess timing and add appropriate post-conversion procedures</option><option value=\"Rely entirely on pre-conversion work\">Rely entirely on pre-conversion work</option><option value=\"Assume the ERP improves every control\">Assume the ERP improves every control</option><option value=\"Reduce evidence because management is busy\">Reduce evidence because management is busy</option></select></div></section>",
