  "explanation": "<h3>Risk associated with estimate susceptibility before controls</h3><p>Estimate complexity affects inherent susceptibility.</p><h3>Risk associated with ineffective approval controls</h3><p>Relevant controls may fail to prevent or detect errors.</p><h3>Illustrative detection risk, as a percentage</h3><p>3% ÷ (60% × 50%) = 10%.</p><h3>Response to post-conversion risks</h3><p>Evidence from the old system may not address risks in the new system.</p>"
